      <p><strong>Cloud Platforms &amp; Infrastructure:</strong> Google Cloud (GCP, Vertex AI, Cloud Storage, Cloud Run, BigQuery, Pub/Sub), AWS (Lambda, S3, Glue, Redshift, DynamoDB, API Gateway, ECS), Firebase, Supabase, Cloud Architecture, Serverless Systems, CI/CD (GitHub Actions, Cloud Build, Terraform, Docker)</p>
